      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْرَى</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, used to night-journeying</i>]. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْرَى مِنْ قُنْفُذٍ</span> [<i>More used to go about by
